  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n120% of 3125 - 90% of ? = 150\n\n⇒ 120/100 × 3125 - 90/100 × ? = 150\n\n⇒ 6/5 × 3125 - 9/10 × ? = 150\n\n⇒ 6 × 625 - 9/10 × ? = 150\n\n⇒ 3750 - 9/10 × ? = 150\n\n⇒ 3750 - 150 = 9/10 × ?\n\n⇒ 3600 = 9/10 × ?\n\n⇒ ? = 3600 × 10/9 = 4000\n\n**Hence, the correct answer is 4000.**",
